[
  {
    "id": "ex06-tab",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "SITL 20 Completion takeoff",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "GUIDED (confirm) \u2192 Arm (confirm) \u2192 Takeoff with completion-tier await on ArduPilot SITL sysid 1. Mode before arm: after a cold SITL boot, armed STABILIZE\u2192GUIDED is often DENIED until GPS/EKF is ready; GUIDED while disarmed succeeds early. NAV_TAKEOFF is DENIED outside GUIDED. The takeoff node uses delivery=complete which waits for IN_PROGRESS then ACCEPTED.",
    "env": []
  },
  {
    "id": "ex06-comment",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "ex06-tab",
    "name": "GUIDED, arm, then takeoff (completion tier)",
    "info": "This flow targets sysid 1 (first ArduPilot SITL). Chain: DO_SET_MODE GUIDED (custom_mode 4, confirm) \u2192 arm (confirm) \u2192 NAV_TAKEOFF 10 m (complete). GUIDED before arm avoids cold-boot DENIED on armed mode change. Without GUIDED, ArduPilot returns MAV_RESULT_DENIED (resultCode 4) for takeoff.\n\nSet completionTimeout to at least 30 s; ArduPilot typically sends IN_PROGRESS within 2 s then ACCEPTED once the vehicle is airborne.\n\nConnection: bind 0.0.0.0:14550, remote 127.0.0.1:14551 for a local Copter SITL started with\n  sim_vehicle.py -v ArduCopter --out udp:127.0.0.1:14550",
    "x": 230,
    "y": 40,
    "wires": []
  },
